            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kejukanakini da yes ikakejaanakinak kere inabin, adilonokin tupuruc aijukunun kes, kabala ebe, ‘Koboŋu cabo ŋinituŋanan ainyein ekerot loerono, kitetenata akusiswamisio, siritupanarete ieedekesio aijaanakin kes, ido iboiete kakwap naabu kainak yes ka lukapapaakus.’ Konye mam itoonokinete akusiki, kwabo mam ipotu kopuput eoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
